    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/c6b6631fa1f7e3611a2623c62bbb5892.avif?t=1742835687\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>Dive into a captivating game where strategy and fantasy collide in a 2D pixel art medieval world. It\u2019s the perfect adventure for those who love to think, plan, and emerge victorious in battle. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/52e41028cfb6f33749453288839c8b4c.poster.avif?t=1742835687\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/52e41028cfb6f33749453288839c8b4c.webm?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/52e41028cfb6f33749453288839c8b4c.mp4?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create Your Army</strong>: Choose from a wide array of units, each with unique abilities. Mix fighters, archers, and mages to assemble your ultimate team. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/a0d260e1b27e3b0e70bd5015a1394df5.poster.avif?t=1742835687\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/a0d260e1b27e3b0e70bd5015a1394df5.webm?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/a0d260e1b27e3b0e70bd5015a1394df5.mp4?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight Epic Bosses</strong>: Encounter fearsome bosses with unique abilities. Tailor your strategy and unit combinations to conquer these giants. A true test of strategy and strength.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/f49b2e5aa361e775cf4651f7fe6a386a.poster.avif?t=1742835687\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/f49b2e5aa361e775cf4651f7fe6a386a.webm?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/f49b2e5aa361e775cf4651f7fe6a386a.mp4?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Unlock Heroes</strong>: Progress through the game to discover and unlock unique units that can change the course of battle. Your strategy, your victories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/03e6281cb7a734eb5d4469ec96ce6bcb.poster.avif?t=1742835687\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/03e6281cb7a734eb5d4469ec96ce6bcb.webm?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895390/extras/03e6281cb7a734eb5d4469ec96ce6bcb.mp4?t=1742835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Little Army Manager</strong> invites you to test your strategic skills in a magical, medieval setting. Build your team, wield spells, and command your way to glory. Are you ready to lead?",
